<title>HUNGARY: CESI INDEX ADVANCES ONE PERCENT TO NEW HIGH.</title>
<headline>CESI INDEX ADVANCES ONE PERCENT TO NEW HIGH.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index gained 9.09 points or 0.56 percent to finish at a new record high of 1,635.55 points on Monday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
